{"term":"average","senses":[{"id":"kaikki:603e5e3bf7b7216601","definition":"Any measure of central tendency, especially any mean, the median, or the mode.","example":"You need to show some averages in an executive summary, show some samples of raw data in the document body, and move the full raw data to an appendix.","pos":"noun","synonyms":[],"antonyms":[],"collocations":[],"usage":"","register":"","wordFamily":[],"source":"English Wiktionary via Kaikki.org","attribution":"English Wiktionary contributors","sourceUrl":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/average#English","license":"CC-BY-SA-4.0"},{"id":"kaikki:132a0329368e81bbd5","definition":"A financial loss due to damage to transported goods; compensation for damage or loss.","example":"Historically, the courts have allowed a general average claim only where the loss occurred as a result of the ship being in immediate peril.[…]The court awarded the carrier the general average claim. It noted that “a ship′s master should not be discouraged from taking timely action to avert a disaster,” and need not be in actual peril to claim general average.","pos":"noun","synonyms":[],"antonyms":[],"collocations":[],"usage":"","register":"","wordFamily":[],"source":"English Wiktionary via Kaikki.org","attribution":"English Wiktionary contributors","sourceUrl":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/average#English","license":"CC-BY-SA-4.0"},{"id":"kaikki:09e5a92420e1539257","definition":"An indication of a player's ability calculated from his scoring record, etc.","example":"batting average","pos":"noun","synonyms":[],"antonyms":[],"collocations":[],"usage":"","register":"","wordFamily":[],"source":"English Wiktionary via Kaikki.org","attribution":"English Wiktionary contributors","sourceUrl":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/average#English","license":"CC-BY-SA-4.0"},{"id":"kaikki:31b6a33ebaf15b23ef","definition":"Constituting or relating to the average.","example":"The average age of the participants was 18.5.","pos":"adj","synonyms":["mean","expectation"],"antonyms":[],"collocations":[],"usage":"not-comparable","register":"not-comparable","wordFamily":["average access time","average bear","average frustrated chump","average Joe","averagely","averageness","average seek time","daily average revenue trades","ensemble average","unaverage","underaverage"],"source":"English Wiktionary via Kaikki.org","attribution":"English Wiktionary contributors","sourceUrl":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/average#English","license":"CC-BY-SA-4.0"},{"id":"kaikki:a56ae625c39332a2b9","definition":"Neither very good nor very bad; rated somewhere in the middle of all others in the same category.","example":"I soon found I was only an average chess player.","pos":"adj","synonyms":["comme ci comme ça","mediocre","medium","middling","unremarkable","so-so","average","comme ci comme ça","crappy","moderate","decent","indifferent","lackluster","meh","mediocre","mid","middling","no great shakes","nothing to write home about","not worth writing home about","OK","okayish","ordinary","pedestrian","unexceptional","uninspiring","shitty","so-so","ok-ok","tolerable","whatever"],"antonyms":["extraordinary"],"collocations":[],"usage":"","register":"","wordFamily":["average access time","average bear","average frustrated chump","average Joe","averagely","averageness","average seek time","daily average revenue trades","ensemble average","unaverage","underaverage"],"source":"English Wiktionary via Kaikki.org","attribution":"English Wiktionary contributors","sourceUrl":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/average#English","license":"CC-BY-SA-4.0"},{"id":"kaikki:61adb90501d0621bf3","definition":"Typical.","example":"The average family will not need the more expensive features of this product.","pos":"adj","synonyms":["conventional","normal","regular","standard","typical","usual","bog-standard","average","basic","bog-standard","common","common as bums","common as dirt","common as muck","common as pig tracks","dime a dozen","everyday","frequent","general